<view class="legal-page">
  <view class="legal-hero"><view class="eyebrow">协议与隐私</view><view class="hero-title">服务规则与<view>个人信息保护</view></view><view class="hero-copy">了解我们提供的服务、如何处理个人信息，以及你可以行使的权利。</view><view wx:if="{{catalog}}" class="version"><text>版本 {{catalog.version}}</text><text>更新 {{catalog.updatedAt}}</text><text>生效 {{catalog.effectiveDate || '待公布'}}</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading && !catalog}}" class="state">正在读取协议文件…</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}<button bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">重新读取</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{catalog}}">
    <view wx:if="{{catalog.ready === false}}" class="notice draft">当前显示工作区草案，尚未发布生效。请以核实并正式发布后的版本及生效日期为准。</view>
    <view class="operator-card"><view class="section-title">运营者与联系信息</view><view class="operator-field"><text>运营主体</text><text selectable>{{catalog.operator.name || '待核实'}}</text></view><view class="operator-field"><text>联系邮箱</text><text selectable>{{catalog.operator.contactEmail || '待核实'}}</text></view><view class="operator-field"><text>联系地址</text><text selectable>{{catalog.operator.address || '待核实'}}</text></view><view class="operator-field"><text>托管服务商</text><text selectable>{{catalog.operator.hostingProvider || '待核实'}}</text></view><view class="operator-field"><text>数据存储地区</text><text selectable>{{catalog.operator.storageRegion || '待核实'}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="document-nav"><button wx:for="{{catalog.documents}}" wx:key="id" class="{{documentId === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pickDocument">{{item.title}}<text>↗</text></button></view><view class="reading-note">所有文件均可在登录前阅读。授权或撤回某项权限，不影响与该权限无关的服务。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="document-card"><view class="document-label">{{selected.id === 'privacy' ? '个人信息保护' : selected.id === 'terms' ? '服务规则' : '透明说明'}}</view><view class="document-title">{{selected.title}}</view><view class="summary">{{selected.summary}}</view><view class="operator">运营主体：{{catalog.operator.name || '待确认'}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{selected.sections.length > 3}}" class="toc"><view>本文件目录</view><button wx:for="{{selected.sections}}" wx:for-item="section" wx:key="anchor" data-anchor="{{section.anchor}}" bindtap="jump">{{section.title}}</button></view>
      <view wx:for="{{selected.sections}}" wx:for-item="section" wx:key="anchor" id="{{section.anchor}}" class="section {{section.important ? 'important' : ''}}"><view class="section-title">{{section.title}}</view><view wx:for="{{section.paragraphs}}" wx:for-item="paragraph" wx:key="index" class="paragraph"><text wx:for="{{paragraph}}" wx:for-item="segment" wx:key="index" class="{{segment.strong ? 'strong' : ''}}" selectable>{{segment.text}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{section.items}}" wx:for-item="paragraph" wx:key="index" class="list-item"><text class="bullet">•</text><view><text wx:for="{{paragraph}}" wx:for-item="segment" wx:key="index" class="{{segment.strong ? 'strong' : ''}}" selectable>{{segment.text}}</text></view></view><view wx:for="{{section.rows}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="index" class="table-record"><view wx:for="{{row}}" wx:for-item="cell" wx:key="label" class="table-cell"><view class="cell-label">{{cell.label}}</view><view class="cell-value"><text wx:for="{{cell.segments}}" wx:for-item="segment" wx:key="index" class="{{segment.strong ? 'strong' : ''}}" selectable>{{segment.text}}</text></view></view></view></view>
      <view class="document-bottom">如需查阅、更正、复制或删除个人信息，请查看《个人信息权利与账号注销指引》。<button bindtap="toTop">回到顶部 ↑</button></view>
    </view><view wx:else class="state">暂未找到这份文件，请从目录选择阅读。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{documentId === 'rights'}}" class="rights-card"><view class="section-title">个人信息权利申请</view><view class="summary">申请与回复仅本人及有权限的平台处理人员可见。请描述必要事项，不填写密码、完整证件号码或他人的资料。</view><block wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="field-label">需要办理的事项</view><picker range="{{requestTypes}}" range-key="title" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="onType" disabled="{{submitting}}"><view class="type-picker">{{requestTypes[typeIndex].title}}<text>⌄</text></view></picker><view class="field-label">具体事项</view><textarea value="{{detail}}" maxlength="2000" placeholder="说明需要查阅、更正或删除的信息，以及你期望的处理方式。" bindinput="onDetail" disabled="{{submitting}}" auto-height/><view wx:if="{{type === 'close'}}" class="close-note">注销由平台核对后办理。担任团长时，可先办理移交或说明实际困难，平台将协助核对；依法需要保留的记录将说明范围与依据。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submitRequest" disabled="{{submitting}}" loading="{{submitting}}">私密提交申请</button></block><button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="login">登录后提交申请</button><view wx:if="{{requestMessage}}" class="request-message">{{requestMessage}}</view><view wx:if="{{ready}}" class="request-list"><view class="list-heading"><view class="section-title">我的申请与回复</view><button bindtap="loadRequests" disabled="{{requestsLoading || submitting}}">刷新</button></view><view wx:if="{{requestsLoading}}" class="summary">正在读取申请…</view><view wx:elif="{{!requests.length}}" class="summary">你还没有提交过权利申请。</view><view wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="id" class="request-record"><view class="request-status">{{item.statusLabel}} · #{{item.id}}</view><view class="request-title">{{item.typeLabel}}</view><view class="request-date">{{item.dateLabel}}</view><view class="request-detail" selectable>{{item.detail}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.response}}" class="response"><view>平台回复</view><view selectable>{{item.response}}</view></view></view></view></view>
  </block>
</view>
